      "observations": "右面：空白襯頁，未見當面文字。 左面：內題無「説」字，與函題分記。訓讀符未見密列。㽲、㽱字形另候㽲／㽱，仍依所示病字頭內形區分。"
    },
    {
      "image": 5,
      "canvas_id": "https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/RB00001243/canvas/p5",
      "image_url": "https://rmda.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/iiif/3/RB00001243%2FRB00001243_00005_0.ptif/full/2000,/0/default.jpg",
      "label": {
